; what is equivalent to `true` holds ("iff-true-elim"), and what holds is equivalent to `true`
; ("iff-true-intro"), propositional.kurt -- e.g. after a chain of equivalences that ends in `⊤`
load propositional
prop A, B
use A iff true
A                               ; by iff-true-elim
use B
B iff true                      ; by iff-true-intro
true iff B                      ; `iff` is symmetric
